Python Libraries-
fastapi
uvicorn
jinja2
torch
torchvision
torchaudio
diffusers
transformers
accelerate
safetensors

fastapi → Web framework

uvicorn → ASGI server to run FastAPI

jinja2 → For rendering HTML templates

torch / torchvision / torchaudio → PyTorch (needed for Stable Diffusion)

diffusers → Hugging Face Diffusers library (Stable Diffusion)

transformers → Required for tokenizer/model support

accelerate → Optimizes GPU/CPU usage

safetensors → Safe and fast model file format

If you’re on CUDA (GPU), make sure to install the correct PyTorch CUDA version instead of plain torch.
For example (for CUDA 11.8):

pip install torch torchvision torchaudio --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu118
